  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 305.02 Applicability. These rules shall apply to the discharge of industrial wastes, as defined in RSA 485-A:2, VI, to a POTW.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 305) #10381, eff 8-1-13; ss by #13241, eff 7-24-21",
